--- !u!114 &2129008162206946052
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4646062645318277979}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1f34e5853c8216b4eac63dd25d7f3323, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Game.Menus.TipBoard
  board: {fileID: 4238327045396751120}
  text: {fileID: 7205257931246914960}
  passedBy: 0.3
  fadeSeconds: 0.5
  firstTip: High Recommended
  firstTipHint: Not this high? You can change your height in the menu.
  hintSize: 0.55
  hintGap: 0.6
  tips:
  - Eat as much candies as you want, this is a game
  - Nothing to throw? Make a fist and start punching
  - Clean your room and watch out for the bug bite
  - 'DONT RUN

    DONT FEAR

    DONT GIVE UP'
  - Drink Water
  - Bump your fists together twice to spend your level-up points
  - Shake a bottle before you throw it. Careful though!
  - Hold B to open the Candy Shop
  - Touch me for a hint
  - Fist Size unlocks flying punches
  - Hold Y to open your bag
  - Press A to pause
  - Lollipop? Hold it at your mouth
  - Squeeze the trigger on a hammer
  - Two hands on a broom hit harder
  - 'Smoke a boong: 60 s power-up'
  - 'Elon Boong: exploding punches'
  - 'Bone Boong: tough as bone'
  - 'Green Boong: grow taller'
  - 'Bus Boong: move faster'
  - Candle out? Shake it
  - The game saves at checkpoints
  - Mind the edge
  - Revive coins can save you
  - Hit the magic hat for a recipe
  - Stone dice block the path
  - Hit a chest to open it
  - Swing your arms to run
  - 'Skull Gun: Don''t do it too fast'
  - Explosions hurt you too
  - Weapons wear out
  - Don't hug the Pumpkin Boss
  - Throw Power makes throws explode
  hints:
  - Candy heals. Its wrap pays the Candy Shop.
  - Squeeze grip and trigger with an empty hand.
  - Smash the bugs before they bite.
  - Okay, dodging is allowed.
  - For real. Take a break now and then.
  - Beat bugs to earn points.
  - 'Needs 1 Throw Power. Too long: boom in your hand.'
  - Pay with candy wraps. It restocks often.
  - Hit me hard for the next tip.
  - '1 point: jab. More points hit harder. 10: triple!'
  - Hold a thing to your chest to put it in.
  - Height, volume and more are in there.
  - Keep it there for 3 seconds.
  - Its head grows and hits harder.
  - Pillow and sword too. They wear out faster.
  - Hold it upright at your mouth, lit candle on the bowl.
  - Punches reach further and blow up on hit.
  - +7 Toughness for 60 seconds.
  - Flying punches go 5 m further too.
  - +7 Move Speed for 60 seconds.
  - 3 quick shakes light it again.
  - Pick your save slot to go on from there.
  - Falling off costs health.
  - 'Clover: get back up. All skulls: game over.'
  - Cook it in the cauldron for a laughing pumpkin.
  - Hit one to see its price. Pay with seeds.
  - Touch the seed inside to take it.
  - Hold X and jog with your arms.
  - Too many quick shots and it blows up.
  - Throw them far, not at your feet.
  - Weapon Efficiency makes them last longer.
  - Too close and he spins. Dodge his pumpkins.
  - Books, bottles, flip-flops. More points, bigger boom.
  strongHit: 2.5
  hitCooldown: 0.5
  hintFadeSeconds: 0.3
  touchDistance: 0.08
  knockDistance: 0.04
  knockDegrees: 7
  knockSounds:
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: be9beca93dc0f514c8220a12fd387f63, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1ab0a3a1ae573ae4a83eec9c81323797, type: 3}
  knockVolume: 0.8
  menuVersion: 1
